sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>DesignerProfilePage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UpdateDesignerProfileBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UpdateDesignerProfileController
  participant DesignerProfile as «entity»<br/>DesignerProfile
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: edit my bio, experience and specialisation
  UI->>B: PUT /api/designer/profile (JWT)
  B->>C: update(Integer designerId, DesignerProfileRequest request)
  C->>DesignerProfile: update()
  DesignerProfile->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerProfile: rows
  DesignerProfile-->>C: result
  C->>DesignerProfile: save()
  DesignerProfile->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerProfile: rows
  DesignerProfile-->>C: result
  C-->>B: DesignerProfileResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result